{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10262","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得引字 · 元晟","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得引字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾见夫子德，谁云习相近。\n数仞不可窥，言味终难尽。\n处喧虑常澹，作吏心亦隐。\n更有嵩少峰，东南爲胜引。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元晟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}